  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-020-consorts-editorial-wyd:p001",
      "text": "六宮位號漢魏以來因襲增置世不同矣建元元年有司奏置貴嬪夫人貴人為三夫人脩華脩儀脩容淑妃淑媛淑儀婕妤容華充華為九嬪美人中才人才人為散職永明元年有司奏貴妃淑妃並加金章紫綬佩于窴玉淑妃舊擬九棘以淑為溫恭之稱妃為亞后之名進同貴妃以比三司夫人之號不殊蕃國降淑媛以比九卿七年復置昭容位在九嬪建元三年太子宮置三內職良娣比開國侯保林比五等侯才人比駙馬都尉",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "reviewed",
      "mentions": [],
      "source_position": {
        "revision_id": "cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:7c36bcf25f9ab8824d179d65db8da4dbd1ca64fb04c1c8a3c950c45709aad119",
        "source_layer": "volume_preface",
        "column_projection": [
          {
            "column": "2L05",
            "pdf_page": 2,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "1上",
            "column_from_right": 5,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=2",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "六宮位號漢魏以來因襲增置世不同矣建元元年有"
          },
          {
            "column": "2L06",
            "pdf_page": 2,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "1上",
            "column_from_right": 6,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=2",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "司奏置貴嬪夫人貴人為三夫人脩華脩儀脩容淑妃"
          },
          {
            "column": "2L07",
            "pdf_page": 2,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "1上",
            "column_from_right": 7,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=2",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "淑媛淑儀婕妤容華充華為九嬪美人中才人才人為"
          },
          {
            "column": "2L08",
            "pdf_page": 2,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "1上",
            "column_from_right": 8,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=2",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "散職永明元年有司奏貴妃淑妃並加金章紫綬佩于"
          },
          {
            "column": "2L09",
            "pdf_page": 2,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "1上",
            "column_from_right": 9,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=2",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "窴玉淑妃舊擬九棘以淑為溫恭之稱妃為亞后之名"
          },
          {
            "column": "2L10",
            "pdf_page": 2,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "1上",
            "column_from_right": 10,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=2",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "進同貴妃以比三司夫人之號不殊蕃國降淑媛以比"
          },
          {
            "column": "3R01",
            "pdf_page": 3,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "1下",
            "column_from_right": 1,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=3",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "九卿七年復置昭容位在九嬪建元三年太子宮置三"
          },
          {
            "column": "3R02",
            "pdf_page": 3,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "1下",
            "column_from_right": 2,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=3",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "內職良娣比開國侯保林比五等侯才人比駙馬都尉"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-020-consorts-editorial-wyd:p002",
      "text": "史臣曰后妃之德著自風謠義起閨房而道化天下繰盆獻種罔非耕織佩管晨興與子同事可以光熙閫業作儷公侯孝昭二后並有賢明之訓不得母臨萬國寶命方昌椒庭虛位有婦人焉空慕周興禎符顯瑞徒萃徽名若使掖作同休陰教遠燮則馬鄧風流復存乎此太祖創命宮禁貶約毀宋明之紫極革前代之踰奢衣不文繡色無紅采永巷貧空有同素室世祖嗣位運藉休平壽昌前興鳳華晚構香栢文檉花梁繡柱雕金鏤寶頗用房帷趙瑟吳趨承閑奏曲歲費傍恩足使充牣事由私蓄無損國儲高宗仗數矯情外行儉陋內奉宮業曾莫云改東昏喪道侈風大扇銷糜海內以贍浮飾哲婦傾城同符殷夏嗚呼所以垂戒於方來也",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "reviewed",
      "mentions": [],
      "source_position": {
        "revision_id": "cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:7c36bcf25f9ab8824d179d65db8da4dbd1ca64fb04c1c8a3c950c45709aad119",
        "source_layer": "historian_appraisal",
        "column_projection": [
          {
            "column": "6L06",
            "pdf_page": 6,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "5上",
            "column_from_right": 6,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "史臣曰后妃之德著自風謠義起閨房而道化天下繰"
          },
          {
            "column": "6L07",
            "pdf_page": 6,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "5上",
            "column_from_right": 7,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "盆獻種罔非耕織佩管晨興與子同事可以光熙閫業"
          },
          {
            "column": "6L08",
            "pdf_page": 6,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "5上",
            "column_from_right": 8,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "作儷公侯孝昭二后並有賢明之訓不得母臨萬國寶"
          },
          {
            "column": "6L09",
            "pdf_page": 6,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "5上",
            "column_from_right": 9,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "命方昌椒庭虛位有婦人焉空慕周興禎符顯瑞徒萃"
          },
          {
            "column": "6L10",
            "pdf_page": 6,
            "half": "左",
            "leaf": "5上",
            "column_from_right": 10,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=6",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "徽名若使掖作同休陰教遠燮則馬鄧風流復存乎此"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R01",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 1,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "太祖創命宮禁貶約毀宋明之紫極革前代之踰奢衣"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R02",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 2,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "不文繡色無紅采永巷貧空有同素室世祖嗣位運藉"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R03",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 3,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "休平壽昌前興鳳華晚構香栢文檉花梁繡柱雕金鏤"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R04",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 4,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "寶頗用房帷趙瑟吳趨承閑奏曲歲費傍恩足使充牣"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R05",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 5,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "事由私蓄無損國儲高宗仗數矯情外行儉陋內奉宮"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R06",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 6,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "業曾莫云改東昏喪道侈風大扇銷糜海內以贍浮飾"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R07",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 7,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "哲婦傾城同符殷夏嗚呼所以垂戒於方來也"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-020-consorts-editorial-wyd:p003",
      "text": "贊曰宣武孝則識有先知高昭誕武世載母儀裴穆儲閫位亦從隳明敬典冊配在宗枝秋宮亦遽軒景前虧文安廢主百憂已離中興秉制揖讓弘規",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "reviewed",
      "mentions": [],
      "source_position": {
        "revision_id": "cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:7c36bcf25f9ab8824d179d65db8da4dbd1ca64fb04c1c8a3c950c45709aad119",
        "source_layer": "historian_praise",
        "column_projection": [
          {
            "column": "7R08",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 8,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "贊曰宣武孝則識有先知高昭誕武世載母儀裴穆儲"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R09",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 9,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "閫位亦從隳明敬典冊配在宗枝秋宮亦遽軒景前虧"
          },
          {
            "column": "7R10",
            "pdf_page": 7,
            "half": "右",
            "leaf": "5下",
            "column_from_right": 10,
            "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/NLC892-411999017142-12428_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC158%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=7",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "文安廢主百憂已離中興秉制揖讓弘規"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
